        {
          "subject": "Re: Motor IE3 4 kW: framework renewal",
          "body": "Dear colleagues at Vesmo Elektromotory a.s.,\n\nThank you for sending your quote for the framework renewal. Our opening proposal rests on our analysis of growing demand and the commercial value of a longer agreement with recurring volume.\n\nYour on-time delivery over the last four quarters was 81.1% (sc:70520@2026Q3).\n\nThe longer framework offers planning certainty and a stronger basis for retaining and developing our business. We are flexible on payment terms, with the options linking earlier payment to a lower price; please let us know which works best for you.\n\nWe can offer either of these packages - please choose the one that suits you better:\nOption A: EUR 217.05 per unit, payment 90 days net, 24-month agreement, Incoterm EXW.\nOption B: EUR 213.42 per unit, payment 14 days net, 24-month agreement, Incoterm EXW.\nOption C: EUR 214.88 per unit, payment 45 days net, 24-month agreement, Incoterm EXW.\n\nWe look forward to agreeing commercially sound terms for our continued relationship.\n\nKind regards\nPurchasing\nHollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH",
