        {
          "subject": "Re: Motor IE3 4 kW: framework renewal",
          "body": "Dear colleagues at Vesmo Elektromotory a.s.,\n\nThank you for improving your counter-offer; this is a constructive move toward agreement. We are making a modest price concession in return and would need a further step from you to close the gap.\n\nThe longer framework and earlier payment offer you planning certainty and quicker payment in exchange for a better price. We are flexible on the delivery term: the EXW option links our taking responsibility for collection to your lowest price, while the other options retain more delivery responsibility with you; please tell us which works best.\n\nWe can offer either of these packages - please choose the one that suits you better:\nOption A: EUR 222.28 per unit, Incoterm DAP, 24-month agreement, payment 14 days net.\nOption B: EUR 215.81 per unit, Incoterm EXW, 24-month agreement, payment 14 days net.\nOption C: EUR 217.96 per unit, Incoterm FCA, 24-month agreement, payment 14 days net.\n\nWe appreciate your constructive approach and look forward to renewing the framework on this basis.\n\nKind regards\nPurchasing\nHollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH",
