          "subject": "Re: Motor IE3 4 kW: framework renewal",
          "body": "Dear colleagues at Vesmo Elektromotory a.s.,\n\nThank you for improving your counter-offer; your further price movement is a constructive contribution toward agreement. We are also making a modest price concession and expect a further step from you in return.\n\nWe are flexible on the delivery term: the EXW option gives you less logistics responsibility in exchange for a lower price, while the longer framework and early payment support planning and cash flow. The FCA and DAP options retain more delivery responsibility with you; please tell us which works best.\n\nWe can offer either of these packages - please choose the one that suits you better:\nOption A: EUR 224.67 per unit, Incoterm DAP, 24-month agreement, payment 14 days net.\nOption B: EUR 218.21 per unit, Incoterm EXW, 24-month agreement, payment 14 days net.\nOption C: EUR 220.36 per unit, Incoterm FCA, 24-month agreement, payment 14 days net.\n\nWe appreciate your continued engagement and look forward to agreeing a commercially sound renewal.\n\nKind regards\nPurchasing\nHollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH",
